{"work_id": "MX1-010", "matched_key": "我们的经济政策", "normalized_offset": 0, "normalized_context": "我们的经济政策131发展对外贸易和发展合作社红色区域的农业现在显然是在向前发展中一九三三年的农产在赣南闽西区域比较一九三二年增加了百分之十五一成半而在闽浙赣边区则增加了百分之二十川陕边区的农业收成良好红色区域在建立的头一二年农业生产往往是下降的1但是经过分配土地后确定了地权加以我们提倡生产农民群众的劳动热情增长了生产便有恢复的形势了现在有些地方不但恢复了而且超过了革命前的生产量有些地方不但恢复了在革命起义过程中荒废了的土地而且开发了新的土地很多的地方组织了劳动互助社和耕", "cue_words": [], "title_form_signal": "near_page_heading", "witness_id": "A-8bfc27ba981e89432b11", "source_url": "https://ebook.dswxyjy.org.cn/dswxbooks/storage/files/20220801/cfd1c7395b455e97e58af81933b2a8e555113/mobile/javascript/search_config.js", "raw_sha256": "69ab9aabd67e1f99fa085322c5e46d1e193bd493a74d54baefa266863ec6bd93", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "maoxuan-official", "volume": 1, "basis": "official_book_landing_and_reader_configuration"}], "kind": "reader_page", "number": 145, "end": 145, "record_path": "archive/records/A-8bfc27ba981e89432b11.json", "text_path": "archive/text/A-8bfc27ba981e89432b11.txt", "source_title": "毛泽东选集（第一卷）〔官方阅读器全文文字层〕", "source_media": "official_page_text", "source_layer": "official_reader_text", "edition_verification_status": "not_independently_verified", "public_url_rechecked_this_run": false, "family": "maoxuan", "id": "C-717f117ea555a55b", "status": "candidate_only_not_work_identity_revision_or_causation", "normalization": "NFKC plus letters/digits only; context is NOT a verbatim quote"}
{"work_id": "MX1-010", "matched_key": "我们的经济政策", "normalized_offset": 0, "normalized_context": "我们的经济政策133是国家经营和合作社经营的事业相当精密的生产计划却是完全必需的确切地计算原料的生产计算到敌区和我区的销场是我们每一种国营工业和合作社工业从开始进行的时候就必须注意的我们有计划地组织人民的对外贸易并且由国家直接经营若干项必要的商品流通例如食盐和布匹的输入食粮和钨砂的输出以及粮食在内部的调剂等现在是异常需要的了这一工作闽浙赣边区方面实行得较早中央区则开始于一九三三年的春季由于对外贸易局等机关的设立已经得到初步的成绩现在我们的国民经济是由国营事业合作社事业和", "cue_words": [], "title_form_signal": "near_page_heading", "witness_id": "A-8bfc27ba981e89432b11", "source_url": "https://ebook.dswxyjy.org.cn/dswxbooks/storage/files/20220801/cfd1c7395b455e97e58af81933b2a8e555113/mobile/javascript/search_config.js", "raw_sha256": "69ab9aabd67e1f99fa085322c5e46d1e193bd493a74d54baefa266863ec6bd93", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "maoxuan-official", "volume": 1, "basis": "official_book_landing_and_reader_configuration"}], "kind": "reader_page", "number": 147, "end": 147, "record_path": "archive/records/A-8bfc27ba981e89432b11.json", "text_path": "archive/text/A-8bfc27ba981e89432b11.txt", "source_title": "毛泽东选集（第一卷）〔官方阅读器全文文字层〕", "source_media": "official_page_text", "source_layer": "official_reader_text", "edition_verification_status": "not_independently_verified", "public_url_rechecked_this_run": false, "family": "maoxuan", "id": "C-24e154df56e17a7f", "status": "candidate_only_not_work_identity_revision_or_causation", "normalization": "NFKC plus letters/digits only; context is NOT a verbatim quote"}
