{"work_id": "MX1-010", "matched_key": "我们的经济政策", "normalized_offset": 0, "normalized_context": "我们的经济政策一九三四年一月中文马克思主义文库毛泽东我们的经济政策一九三四年一月这是毛泽东在一九三四年一月二十二日至二月一日在江西瑞金召开的第二次全国工农兵代表大会上的报告的一部分这个报告是一月二十四日至二十五日作的只有最无耻的国民党军阀才会在他们自己统治的区域内弄到差不多民穷财尽的地步还会天天造谣说红色区域如何破坏不堪帝国主义和国民党的目的在于破坏红色区域破坏正在前进的红色区域的经济建设工作破坏已经得到解放的千百万工农民众的福利因此他们不但组织了武装力量进行军事上的围", "cue_words": [], "title_form_signal": "near_page_heading", "witness_id": "A-f915ce9d0d17d60ae518", "source_url": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/marxist.org-chinese-mao-193401.htm", "raw_sha256": "66d027fd96f759d14ce74a8ce92c168bffb8bc4684f798253b6ea2e32784cb7d", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "maoxuan-mia-catalogue", "volume": 1, "basis": "source_catalogue_not_print_collation"}], "kind": "web_lines", "number": 1, "end": 30, "record_path": "archive/records/A-f915ce9d0d17d60ae518.json", "text_path": "archive/text/A-f915ce9d0d17d60ae518.txt", "source_title": "我们的经济政策", "source_media": "html", "source_layer": "web_transcription", "edition_verification_status": "not_independently_verified", "public_url_rechecked_this_run": false, "family": "maoxuan", "id": "C-71923b7f5622c341", "status": "candidate_only_not_work_identity_revision_or_causation", "normalization": "NFKC plus letters/digits only; context is NOT a verbatim quote"}
